"Matadero, 'the Slaughterhouse', is the offshore facility where Earth's yearly demon is fought."
"It can be seen from Anesidora through binoculars and reached by boat."
"Interfaces warn boaters not to go farther, and the SkySea Guard patrols the waters near it."
"Anesidora's Battle Groups take turns fighting the demon there."
"The fighting Battle Group stays in residence at Matadero for a few weeks."
"One Velra Chainer S-rank is always at Matadero, using Mass Bestowal to support the fighters."
"The official Demon Day is probably a fake date; the real one is when it is announced over."
"No media are allowed at the demon fight."
"Matadero is 'the cube', towering mirrored walls partly submerged, with no seafloor anchors."
"The cube has not moved in more than seventy years."
"Inside is an arena whose containment area is sealed on top with transparent barriers."
"Layers of shielding ring it; boats that come too close smash into them."
"The System warns boaters off, and the Contract is withdrawn from that patch of Earth."
"Demons break through there, where such things should break through, in the spot prepared."
"About two dozen chosen Avowed fight each demon in waves of six; non-combatants watch."
"A Sway messenger relays word from the Contract, since interfaces fail there."
"Two knights monitor and back up the Battle Group from inside."
"On one attack night a hijacked submarine bomb struck its shield; the cube held."
"The blast scattered a magical contaminant that sent floods across Anesidora."
"A helipad sits high on the cube above the waves."
"A multi-floor healing hospital inside is fully equipped and mostly empty."
"Its storerooms hold wax-sealed boxes, vials of essential elements and non-humanoid restraints."
"Hospital showers spray potions, and patient rooms have fake windows that show maps."
"A morgue floor lies below; a narrow single-person corridor leads to the residential section."
"The residential section looks like a gray hotel lobby, served by the Butcher's Canteen."
"Visiting knights Esh-erdi and Lind-otta keep a hot, wood-paneled suite with a real window there."
"Only authorized people may call in or out of Matadero."
"B-ranks cannot join the Matadero Battle Groups, and everyone there gets a secrecy tattoo."
"Matadero is a short flight over open ocean from Apex."
"After the attack it served as the wizard disaster crew's housing and 'green room'."
"Its residential section rises about twenty floors, with tiny cupboard rooms on top."
"Knee-high soft red lights line one hallway, and its roof serves as a launch point."
"A wide teleport alcove, Flood Trap 2, lies deep below the waterline."
"The healer Porti-loth grew a makeshift healing grove on one hospital floor."
